flowchart TD
    N1[Confirm scope and disjoint write boundaries] --> D1[Scan repo conventions on local env]
    N1 --> D2[Scan script layout on local env]
    D1 --> W1[Write csv-report example in own worktree]
    D2 --> W1
    D1 --> W2[Write json-summary example in own worktree]
    D2 --> W2
    W1 --> V1[Run both examples against fixtures]
    W2 --> V1
    V1 --> G1{Validation gate}
    G1 -->|pass| T1[Root writes examples index on real checkout]
    G1 -->|repair required| R1[Apply one minimal repair]
    R1 --> V2[Re-run affected example]
    V2 -->|pass| T1
    V2 -->|fail| X1[Stop with evidence]
